                <pb facs="0181" n="171" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv09/pg171"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Note for the Supreme Council</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Plebiscite in Teschen</hi></p>
                <p>The Commissions on Polish and Czecho-Slovakian affairs, after having examined the
                    enclosed letter of the Interallied Control Commission of Teschen (Annex “A”),
                    propose that the Secretary General of the Conference address to this Commission
                    the answer in Annex “B”.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1919-11-11">November 11,
                        1919</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
